00:14:59.020 --> 00:15:00.670
Eevee?

00:15:24.650 --> 00:15:26.440
I won!

00:15:26.440 --> 00:15:27.800
No, <i>I</i> won!

00:15:27.800 --> 00:15:29.540
No, <i>I</i> did!

00:15:34.320 --> 00:15:36.080
Huh? Dewgong’s not here.

00:15:37.570 --> 00:15:39.330
Koharu and Eevee aren’t either.

00:15:45.710 --> 00:15:49.060
Huntail. Deep Sea Pokémon.
Water type.

00:15:49.060 --> 00:15:54.300
It uses its fish-shaped tail to attract prey,
then swallows them whole with its large, gaping mouth.

00:16:14.480 --> 00:16:16.430
Dewgong! Swim for that rock!

00:16:54.430 --> 00:16:55.400
Eevee!

00:16:57.370 --> 00:16:59.250
