00:17:43.200 --> 00:17:44.500
I don’t know...

00:17:44.500 --> 00:17:47.490
I’ve never seen it use
anything other than Water Gun.

00:17:47.490 --> 00:17:50.170
Uonoragon. Can you do it?

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:53.510
Something like...
Jaw Bite, maybe?

00:17:54.490 --> 00:17:56.380
Oh, it’s fine if you can’t.

00:18:05.550 --> 00:18:08.060
That was amazing, Uonoragon!

00:18:11.230 --> 00:18:12.830
Koharu! Eevee!

00:18:12.830 --> 00:18:13.910
Are you okay?

00:18:13.910 --> 00:18:15.810
Yeah! Thanks, everyone!

00:18:16.380 --> 00:18:19.590
