00:19:10.040 --> 00:19:11.040
You did it!

00:19:11.040 --> 00:19:12.920
Was that... Copycat?

00:19:23.680 --> 00:19:25.870
I wonder what they’re talking about.

00:19:25.870 --> 00:19:27.680
I bet it’s apologizing.

00:19:27.680 --> 00:19:30.310
So it wasn’t all bad.

00:19:57.110 --> 00:19:58.320
Dewgong...

00:20:07.040 --> 00:20:07.930
Take this.

00:20:07.930 --> 00:20:09.640
A Water Stone?

00:20:09.640 --> 00:20:13.760
I thought it’d be nice to have,
as one possibility for Eevee.

00:20:15.400 --> 00:20:18.850
Someday,
you might end up using it.

00:20:18.850 --> 00:20:20.860
But even if you don’t use it,
I won’t mind.

00:20:22.410 --> 00:20:23.610
Thank you!

00:20:30.220 --> 00:20:31.290
Eevee.

00:20:32.580 --> 00:20:33.880
Listen for a moment.

00:20:34.620 --> 00:20:37.600
Koharu... Are you going to...

00:20:37.600 --> 00:20:38.380
...use that stone?

00:20:38.780 --> 00:20:41.150
This is a Water Stone.

00:20:41.150 --> 00:20:45.890
If you touch it,
you might evolve into Showers.

00:20:47.390 --> 00:20:51.710
But... You have all sorts of possibilities.

00:20:51.710 --> 00:20:53.890
So I want you to choose carefully.

00:21:18.500 --> 00:21:21.850
Eevee really understood
how you felt, Koharu!

00:21:21.850 --> 00:21:24.970
It’s just like my Mom once told me:

00:21:24.970 --> 00:21:27.750
“There’s no need to rush!”

00:21:27.750 --> 00:21:30.720
So you don’t have to
rush things, either!

00:21:33.660 --> 00:21:37.500
Koharu and Eevee have decided to move forward
one step at a time.

00:21:37.500 --> 00:21:41.600
The road leading to their evolution
has only just begun!

